      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "MSP is recommended by CACP but final approval is given by the Cabinet Committee on Economic Affairs (CCEA) chaired by the Prime Minister.",
        "Remember PMFBY insurance premium percentages: 2% for Kharif, 1.5% for Rabi, and 5% for Commercial/Horticultural crops.",
        "Fair and Remunerative Price (FRP) is announced specifically for Sugarcane instead of regular MSP."
